{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "ac2ac1a015897d6cb93c811d44e1559f447e57a4daf3002f5d2834afcaa23cd6", "ja": "妖精たちの宣伝活動", "zh": "妖精们的宣传活动", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1717ceed8416bd7767bc2d9bdd3cfb6aa7ca634212d9192b52a286c03935f698", "ja": "公演成功のため、トーク力を鍛えるべく\nチラシ配りをするFairyメンバー。\n順調にチラシを配る恵美、朋花、千鶴に比べ\n上手くいかない紬だったが、恵美達の助言で\n見事チラシを手渡すことに成功する。", "zh": "为了让公演成功，Fairy的成员开始以发传单\n来训练谈话技巧。相较于顺利发传单的惠美、\n朋花和千鹤，䌷进行得并不顺利，但听了惠美\n等人的建议后，她也成功亲手发出传单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "a173798c6154c0e48bc84fe738c2463168532d06ade4a97efce75729101faf45", "ja": "そこのお姉さん～！　今度、アタシたち765プロの\nFairyっていうチームで、ライブをするんだ～。", "zh": "这位姐姐～！这次我们765艺能里，\n叫做Fairy的分队要开演唱会～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "6e2194e9b0ff8f612d6487b6a895c39697a8bba93d71f740d1e9a5bd999d7bbd", "ja": "よかったら、このチラシをど～ぞ♪\nぜ～ったい楽しいから、劇場に遊びに来てね！", "zh": "不介意的话请收下传单～♪\n绝～对会很有趣的，要来剧场玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "66884645a86961f895fca3752d985d1cdbd833aaf83365256798c476a91f2f0c", "ja": "（自称・トーク大臣の恵美によれば、\n「トーク力を鍛えるにはとにかく場数！」らしい）", "zh": "（据自称最健谈的惠美所言，\n似乎「练口才就是要靠实战！」）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "76bec1cfa6bcacf63b95a929d1e71c645294b2fb23b18b6641cb8cf73103a85b", "ja": "（そんな恵美の発案で、Fairyのメンバー全員で\nチラシ配りをすることになったのだが……）", "zh": "（于是惠美提议让Fairy的所有成员\n一起来发传单……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c1762ff44498d93beed89fcb3934cd13f488ba8be21f7a5306eeabcbd07fede", "ja": "そうなの！　これみんなの手作りチラシなんだよ？　　\nすっごいかわいいでしょ♪", "zh": "对呀！这是大家亲手做的传单喔！\n超可爱的对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "d75bfd4cc3f480a2a5ecb8b02df51147b4cf91d0386392ae977a4a36181cfd3c", "ja": "ほら、この絵は静香が描いたの。カワイイよね～！\nあ、もらってくれてありがとっ。待ってるよ～♪", "zh": "看，这张图是静香画的，很可爱吧～！\n啊，谢谢你收下，等你来喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f06eb58717976a10fffcaa3d3bb00de58a22b3d05e1cde31559347151b0cffab", "ja": "（さすが自称トーク大臣。どんどんチラシを\n配っていくな……。他のみんなはどうだろう？）", "zh": "（不愧是自称最健谈的惠美，\n发得真快……其他人怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "52dc477a7529d82e427bf34b153388c0b555b67861e9b6fcb2f3f7b1e8b029b9", "ja": "お～っほっほっほ！\n呼び込みのカギを握るのは、かけ声ですわ！", "zh": "哦～呵呵呵！\n招揽客人的关键就是口号！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "6cdc73e74e443f7186c0b29b41e88c815019d4797eee233785083cb717c39e7d", "ja": "幸いなことに私、つい先日も家の手伝いで\nチラシを配っ……。", "zh": "幸好前几天才帮家里\n发过传单……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "563b144e2e4f5bab75f568d15768621d0857a21493c9e5dbe9111c1fcfcd69e2", "ja": "……っていた大学の友人から、コツは\nかけ声というのを、聞いたばかりですわ！", "zh": "……本小姐刚从这样说的大学同学那边\n得知口号的重要性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "2b1ea7068b48f02b07865c0a070e4844c2e7cbca7ad371584020418f574fb1d8", "ja": "とにかく、みなさま！　765プロがお送りする\nFairyチームの公演を、ぜひ見に来てくださいな♪", "zh": "总之，各位！务必要来看\n765艺能举行的Fairy队公演呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4a75b182021351ac3b625bf93e287e5d29746c1feb4504202e5d2cad0c6e3e3e", "ja": "（どんどんチラシがなくなっていく！\nセレブな千鶴さんに、こんな特技があったとは……）", "zh": "（传单不断在消失！\n想不到名流千鹤竟然有这种特殊技能……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "8db8f670763538d7934e596451dc960552df1e8fecccb7a9865b4d9875e4d802", "ja": "押してはいけません～♪\n聖母の愛は、子豚ちゃんたち全員に平等ですよ～♪", "zh": "不可以推挤～♪\n圣母的爱对所有小猪们都是平等的喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bcf7365369250afa9044819998717e5eb397c4ba6faaf9ed2dcfc3ebd427f9ed", "ja": "（そして朋花の周りには、\nいつの間にか、あんなに人だかりが……）", "zh": "（然后在朋花身边，\n什么时候聚集了这么多人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "dd886a0a2730f36631bf8d0a499cfd6c3e3db6c51a6ba85479cdf48a49deb1ed", "ja": "チラシはまだたくさんありますから\n焦らないでくださいね～♪", "zh": "传单还有很多很多，\n请不要着急喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1015_tukou", "source_sha256": "b9582570ec8ba7acd472149da4c0f98a12d45c2988e1057e809bea1dd257b255", "ja": "く、ください！　10枚ください！", "zh": "请、请给我！请给我10张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1016_tukou", "source_sha256": "57aa4be127db19c2b712cf7ba974e471e8af14a7cbd55fdd90d6e90b58183437", "ja": "100枚ください！　ていうか僕が配ります！", "zh": "请给我100张！不如让我发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1017_tukou", "source_sha256": "554d0390d901c0ebcffaad7c5dc3f5d12a938f0fd51852762156037a11eaf351", "ja": "むしろお願いです！　僕に配らせてください！！", "zh": "不如说拜托了！请让我来发吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fda7ac79bd792712853e698ecee2bbc6653efb0165f2961a33c0426832341d6d", "ja": "（朋花は、恵美や千鶴さんとは\nまた別の意味ですごいな……）", "zh": "（跟惠美、千鹤不同，\n朋花就另一个层面来看也好厉害啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f2e8886bfc3e0d21dbabc0b89eb4a2ea3876f7d3fa43fcececf36ab5381b0561", "ja": "（やり方はそれぞれだけど、これなら\n宣伝もかねたトーク力アップ作戦は……）", "zh": "（虽然做法各有不同，\n但宣传兼提升谈话技巧大作战……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1a7a2e279fe5c644ce0640e8fafeffbe2d961ef9634edd0019fc53cbf87dcefb", "ja": "あ、あの……。\n今度、765プロの……Fairyチームの公演が……。", "zh": "那、那个……\n这次765艺能有……Fairy队的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "28879781b1f61ccd080d934aa3fd177a09cf601f21456bc56352a1160f71b641", "ja": "（紬は……苦戦してるみたいだな。\n渡すタイミングをつかめないのか……あっ！）", "zh": "（䌷……似乎陷入了苦战呢。\n抓不到递传单的时机点吗……啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "2482533746df1bd01840a5c4df60e916a53b0812432b14105c1277075e687495", "ja": "紬、後ろから人が！", "zh": "䌷，后面有人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aa05990a969b7db00cc8001ee5d8ad082f307725674b0ce3842c1656ecd8dae5", "ja": "え？　なにを……きゃっ！？", "zh": "咦？什么……呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1026_se", "source_sha256": "15a4c3c1ee04750134019229f9e2d5e63724e3158c05e9b1d44bf604cc9127a1", "ja": "ドシン！", "zh": "咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "88868c44f9300b778d3c9a3f87fd6ec53fdcd033c1366e9a94443ba2763e708f", "ja": "大変だったね、紬。どこか怪我とかしてない？", "zh": "真危险呢，䌷，你有没有受伤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1029_038chz", "source_sha256": "08c582b8711a6093ae64ed46b83c2568adbeeb55a6dc88e3753170a3829ace2b", "ja": "紬、少し休憩した方がいいですわ。\n{$P$}、何か飲み物を……。", "zh": "䌷，休息一下比较好喔。\n{$P$}，有没有喝的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1169d2315179dc4ec65673585f504daf493a17f100225112b668b8f08e2586a3", "ja": "そうですね。紬、冷たいお茶でいいか？", "zh": "是啊。䌷，冰茶可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a002f8457b81639c8d5c1a6e5fafedfb5161a132f375711c8d693ef14a54446b", "ja": "おふたりとも……お気遣い、ありがとうございます。\nその、{$P$}も……。", "zh": "两位……谢谢你们关心。\n那个，{$P$}也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a0b5a3234d8582825fa29ffd7b5785127d8482e8ad9c29582bd4921527550760", "ja": "でも、大丈夫です。まだ1枚も配れていないのに、\n休むわけにはいきません。", "zh": "但没关系的，而且我一张都还没发出去，\n可不能休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f7b59e7a7f71362405cfe63b9119681d949d9a16f7a71cf1b6e626a1413a5e5e", "ja": "紬……。", "zh": "䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_1034", "source_sha256": "a26d21fa49233550d254c47c0998de3448195e5b2ab783677eaf84080469c611", "ja": "深呼吸をさせる", "zh": "让她深呼吸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3b623c8d835c09c9066fa17ad75a51cddefa378be4f3924de13cf0b55c5b2442", "ja": "一度、深呼吸をしてみよう、紬。\nそれから、人の流れをゆっくり観察してみるんだ。", "zh": "先深呼吸一下吧，䌷。\n然后再慢慢试着观察人流。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "797974f706aedb9df5d6e1a094ad889242161f7ad11db9b1cbbd422f288ef343", "ja": "つまり、私はもう見ているだけでいいから……、\n邪魔だけはするな、と……？", "zh": "意思是叫我站着看就好了……\n不要出来碍事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2003_p", "source_sha256": "ce4765aa77ba85ebd78506d0b3c1e5a43b5d9adb63cb2b8b81346ac45d9dc25d", "ja": "ち、違う違う！　落ち着こうってことだ。受け取って\nもらえそうなタイミングを、まずは感じないと。", "zh": "不、不是不是！是要你先冷静下来，\n要先试着感受人们会收下传单的时机才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dbb4c28d62a2d8071b60b025febfb5c9e7bd756c8ce2fbaa817c18b881043ad1", "ja": "そ、そういうことでしたか。\n受け取ってもらえるタイミング……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊，\n会收下的时机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "324701fa831d59a93e32cdb1940626954e0213af1e9edf94585fdb119712996f", "ja": "確かに、そのようなことは考えていませんでした。\n難しいものですね……。", "zh": "我的确没有想到这一点，\n真是困难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2006_p", "source_sha256": "a15df0d5ccb1e81a465087b48be38060409d9b3194df2a44f03d5f8123d89df8", "ja": "（紬が考え込んでしまった。どうすれば……）", "zh": "（䌷陷入了沈思，怎么办……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2007_020meg", "source_sha256": "79db373973d0f59fe8589b1cf760628fd11a39c9a942f3ae24c5f8bc58573b6b", "ja": "つ～むぎ？", "zh": "䌷～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "259f2cb6728f62902fcfc490464503d2a1720c1d6995828a30dcf701e14f8b9e", "ja": "は、はい？　なんですか、所さん。", "zh": "我、我在。什么事呢，所？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2009_020meg", "source_sha256": "083f3c77f28d8a8c786439341c5c75640183f55625fdaba96837508fe69f77cf", "ja": "ファンになってくれるかもしれない人と、1対1で\nお話しできるなんて、すっごく楽しいと思わない？", "zh": "你不觉得，能和可能成为粉丝的人\n一对一讲话，是非常开心的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bcbba9a1832803b27326fb62f397be2300997bfe89bb0554f4e96013071173d7", "ja": "楽しい……？", "zh": "开心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2011_038chz", "source_sha256": "1382c60326db6ac33f883c0739030505b950a53e438fc442e639e03257bf0053", "ja": "そうですわ。このチラシは、\nわたくしたちの劇場への招待状のようなもの……。", "zh": "是呀。\n这份传单就像是我们剧场的邀请函……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2012_038chz", "source_sha256": "a4633005f4fc90973d076ee773d392aacc855d28546372869f621a917e0fbc02", "ja": "このチラシがきっかけで、劇場に足を運んでくださる\nかもしれないなんて、素敵なことですわ！", "zh": "人们可能会因为这张传单，\n动身前来剧场，真是件美妙的事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d6d54881d86668aa64c41e2df734364a0228f2b8dbdff47f87ab511b2bd939d3", "ja": "わかりました。私、もう一度、チャレンジしてきます。\n{$P$}、よろしいですか？", "zh": "我知道了，我会再挑战一次。\n{$P$}，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2015_p", "source_sha256": "c6e01cc5db1043058364c489a0a8d5fb91033dbd257a111c7b7912e1397034b7", "ja": "もちろん。\n落ち着いて、息を吸って、周りを見て行こう！", "zh": "当然。\n冷静下来，慢慢呼吸，观察四周吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "00073297b9a7e0de0367791cffbc09c3ccb983d3eaf5a6c3865cd455da802d3a", "ja": "すぅ……、はぁ……。\nまずは人の流れをよく見て……。", "zh": "（吸气……吐气……）\n首先要仔细观察人流……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5ee8254ade0c2cc2fe465bb5648d91f8c1422d8196b570147c25b5d84adb7475", "ja": "お客さまを、ご招待……。\nあ……、あの！　少し、よろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "招待客人……\n啊……那个！可以稍微打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2018_tukou", "source_sha256": "f40290f9f641203dfbaff72706ece0433662290ef94b6f3a4367a24e276cc5dd", "ja": "はい？　なんでしょう？", "zh": "嗯？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ce2d03e87c605d24c69f677ebdfe3c350c66caec43f4274b45551f454db22906", "ja": "私は、765プロライブ劇場の白石紬と申します。近々\nFairyチームとして、公演を行うことになりました。", "zh": "我是765艺能演唱会剧场的白石䌷，\n近日将以Fairy队成员的身份举行公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28387e1b5438070e495c5adbfd5a844ebd756dcb4a2d7ec46581d038b89d7e6a", "ja": "その……もしよろしければ、\nお気軽に、足をお運びいただけたら幸いです。", "zh": "那个……若是方便的话，\n欢迎您前来剧场观赏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "19a936bb8b171ad62a2eb95ba6b6817453bc00679ce5e9ecd055332eb38672de", "ja": "こちらがチラシとなります。\n……受け取っていただけますでしょうか？", "zh": "这是传单。\n……您愿意收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2022_tukou", "source_sha256": "942281e903ddc6b976a32be93d8d6407610557f70c90d65bdc9565bb6a177a1a", "ja": "…………っ！", "zh": "…………！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2b0afb7da9de1a43c1ff4e2dfb3c3ffcfc2a29afe6552709887c578ec61a5462", "ja": "あの……？", "zh": "请问……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2024_tukou", "source_sha256": "556292675f34d587589b86253db8d4de86d1b6ce802f8823cb115542de8ff17d", "ja": "あ、すみませんっ！　チラシ、ありがとうございます。\n絶対に行きます！　楽しみにしてますね！", "zh": "啊，不好意思！谢谢你的传单。\n我一定会去的！我很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d195ee3e6fec8bbe516b5ef75389c64837290e19c3beacc4e6cabcf5d666fe4c", "ja": "は……はい！\nありがとうございますっ！", "zh": "好……好的！\n感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2026_020meg", "source_sha256": "2b40aa590295d709d90f81fba8d11b9f20c4fcc831905cb47092dfbd22a594a8", "ja": "紬、おめでと～♪", "zh": "䌷，恭喜你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a5ac3ba3adb9a4c834ff74b51e530498f6a8090daa9ebb1017209df47059448d", "ja": "所さんと二階堂さんのアドバイスのおかげです。\n本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "这是多亏了所和二阶堂的建议，\n真的非常感谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "09c6f2e35998360df375d61d95d9c81c4965716438d2af5d33f4aeacbe86dad5", "ja": "それから……、{$P$}も……。", "zh": "还有……{$P$}也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2029_p", "source_sha256": "4b2e9f3f9002fd25510def20150a01d8e1d60463fd23de8871db7a062b621fda", "ja": "よく頑張ったな、紬。\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "你很努力呢，䌷。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2030_038chz", "source_sha256": "552aa46a5606d567a7508d3d81a48dbd99d599ae9d6e9b5afe2eaca3d50549e2", "ja": "紬がチラシを差し出したあの方、受け取る時、\nずっとあなたを見つめていましたわね。", "zh": "䌷刚刚发出传单的对象，\n他收下传单时一直盯着你看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2031_020meg", "source_sha256": "b798843773eb0ca796eb3d9495aa6d1e1b1f778cbb644e7859a5d6986de3cd27", "ja": "もしかしたら、さっきの人、\n紬のファンになっちゃったのかも！", "zh": "说不定刚刚那个人啊，\n已经变成䌷的粉丝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dbf1e628580c57d53c6408111cdf6132d4d25565dfdb018fa86395d90ff9f238", "ja": "そ、そんな……！", "zh": "怎、怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2033_p", "source_sha256": "4a9a62b666ae1beabb5b445e6e1739539b0e756435437a22e06327c51ac39328", "ja": "よかったじゃないか。人の心をつかめたのなら、\nそれは紬の魅力が伝わったってことだよ。", "zh": "这不是很好吗？只要能抓住人心，\n就代表对方理解了䌷的魅力所在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cd23b5b7a3a2a753b168ce6dfed6d60701fcd2c4c38a47306ea159cea0b3691b", "ja": "ま、まだまだ、チラシは残っています。\nですから、そのように褒めるのは……どうかと……。", "zh": "我、我手上还有很多传单，\n所以像这样称赞我……不太适当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bb24f4e1d6d06a87ad9420c06d10aa327ba410aac05d5bcff99db6e7a5c461e4", "ja": "い、行きましょう、所さん、二階堂さんっ。\nあちらで天空橋さんが、おひとりで……。", "zh": "我、我们走吧，所、二阶堂。\n天空桥一个人在那里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2037_020meg", "source_sha256": "4696ab5f73b9ab5dff9619f56e8457ba7f371d62cfc0a8c639a9a0d802ac0467", "ja": "わ！　朋花のまわり、さっきより\nすごい人だかりになってる！", "zh": "哇！朋花身边聚集的人潮\n比刚刚还要更多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2038_038chz", "source_sha256": "c9a0a19a2d0a2ad3a52b4754eba9a030c3a6f55a925af74fd81890ce16f0b4b7", "ja": "これは、急いでお手伝いしなくてはいけませんわね！\n腕が鳴りま……、コホン。最善を尽くしますわ！", "zh": "得赶紧去帮忙才行呢！\n本小姐已经跃跃欲……咳咳，本小姐会尽力而为！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2039_p", "source_sha256": "8cff406ade9f3da9a003c58f430cac1b5e64ff7469991009eb714be9ae844dd2", "ja": "（恵美たちのおかげで、\n紬も自信がついたみたいだな）", "zh": "（多亏了惠美她们，\n䌷似乎也得到了信心呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_03_2040_p", "source_sha256": "eda94d94d75e113819bb1447f4136760550fce172fb2101b04acf148713701ca", "ja": "（公演は自分たちで作り上げるもの。\nこの調子なら期待できそうだ！）", "zh": "（公演是偶像自己打造的。\n这样一来应该很值得期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
